  "notes": "FORMS:\n{上|じょう} (on, projection) + {映|えい} (reflect, project) → project on screen\n{上映|じょうえい}する (to screen, to show)\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {上映中|じょうえいちゅう} (now showing)\n- {上映時間|じょうえいじかん} (running time)\n- {上映館|じょうえいかん} (screening theater)\n- {上映期間|じょうえいきかん} (screening period)\n- {先行|せんこう}{上映|じょうえい} (advance screening)\n- {特別|とくべつ}{上映|じょうえい} (special screening)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {公開|こうかい} (release, premiere)\n- {放映|ほうえい} (TV broadcast)\n- {上演|じょうえん} (stage performance)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{上映|じょうえい} is for films/movies. {上演|じょうえん} is for stage performances (plays, musicals). {放映|ほうえい} is for TV broadcasts.",
